      "content": "Please do not wait until tomorrow or try taking ibuprofen, as relying on self-care could delay life-saving treatment for preeclampsia or pre-eclampsia with severe features. Even though ER visits can feel overwhelming, getting checked today is far safer, cheaper in the long run, and ensures you won't feel excessively heavy or unwell later. Your healthcare team can provide the support and comfort you need immediately, and they want you to be diagnosed and treated exactly now. Please prioritize your safety and contact your obstetrician or go to the ER today.",
